<title>GERMANY: Germany's Herzog to meet Clinton in U.S. in July.</title>
<headline>Germany's Herzog to meet Clinton in U.S. in July.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German President Roman Herzog will pay a three-day visit to the United States in July during which he will meet U.S. President Bill Clinton, Herzog's office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>A statement said Herzog would be in the United States from July 22 to 24 at Clinton's invitation and would meet the U.S. leader on July 24.</p>
</text>
